#ASSERT (`reference: reg 83(א) of the licensing regulations to s 257א`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the same words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
#ASSERT (`reference: reg 83(א) of the licensing regulations to s 257א`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `the official page image of the words as published; that no later instrument touched them is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
