#ASSERT (`reference: the enacting formula of the licensing regulations to s 145א`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `the official page image of the words as published; that no later instrument touched them is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
-- Defect C and its two readings, and the control for C and D: limb (a) the consolidation only; limb (b) the page image of Kovetz HaTakanot 6729 p. 194, except for reading B, which no page prints.
#ASSERT (`reference: respondent definition, as printed, to s 198א`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
#ASSERT (`reference: respondent definition, as printed, to s 198א`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `the official page image of the words as published; that no later instrument touched them is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
